I found 7 issues, ranked most severe first. The two I checked by running code are #2 and #3. I verified the timeout claims against https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks. Command hooks do default to 600s and UserPromptSubmit to 30s. SessionEnd hooks share a 1.5s budget, and a per-hook `timeout` raises that budget up to 60s, so leaving SessionEnd untimed is correct.

The build passes, and the claudecode package tests and the new doctor and setup tests pass. I did not run the full `mise run check`. The diff is against the merge-base with upstream/main, plus the uncommitted changes, with the untracked docs/*.html files left out.

